# Project Rules for 13 Gold Diamonds Member Portal

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React + Vite (SPA) + React Router
- Styling: Tailwind CSS (mobile-first) + shadcn/ui
- Auth: Firebase Authentication (Google provider only)
- Content: Google Sheets (source of truth) → serverless API → CDN cache
- Hosting: Vercel

## Code Style
- Mobile-first responsive design
- Use shadcn/ui components where possible
- Server-side auth checks for protected content (don't rely on client-side only)

## Caching Strategy
- Use CDN cache headers (s-maxage + stale-while-revalidate) for shared content
- Fetch Google Sheets server-side only (never expose credentials to browser)
- For member-only content, verify Firebase ID token before returning data

## Security
- Never expose Firebase Admin SDK or Google Sheets credentials to the browser
- All admin actions (user management, etc.) must run in Vercel Serverless Functions
- Verify admin role via Firebase ID token + custom claims/roles before allowing admin endpoints

## Environment Variables
- Reference `.env.example` for all required environment variables and setup instructions
- `.env.example` contains Firebase, Google Sheets, and CDN cache configuration templates
